    <!-- Subject -->
    <div class="subject">
        <b>Subject: <u>Allotment Letter of Amalgamated Plots</u></b>
    </div>

    <!-- Intro -->
    <div class="content">
        Your Letter / Affidavit dated <b><span class="pppdate"></span></b> for amalgamation of Plot No.
        <b><span class="pAmalgamatedPlot1"></span></b>, Reference Number <b><span class="pAmalgamatedReg1"></span></b>
        & Plot No. <b><span class="pAmalgamatedPlot2"></span></b>, Reference Number <b><span class="pAmalgamatedReg2"></span></b>,
        Sector <b><span class="pamalgamatedSector"></span></b>, Phase <b><span class="pamalgamatedPhase"></span></b> refers.
    </div>

    <div class="col-sm-12 mt-2 mb-5" style="text-align:justify;">
        <ol style="padding-left: 7px;">
            <li style="padding-left: 0.5rem;">
                <p style="font-size: 21px;">
                    The amalgamation of your plot has been approved. Consequent to the amalgamation of your plot,
                    you are hereby issued this letter which will be treated as a formal allotment letter
                    for the amalgamated plot.
                </p>
            </li>
            <li style="padding-left: 0.5rem; margin-top:20px !important">
                <p style="font-size: 21px;">
                    N-Stack reserves the right to make adjustment due to site constraints or change in town planning
                    and impose additional development charges at later stages, if necessary.
                </p>
            </li>
           

        </ol>

    </div>

    <!-- Plot Details -->
    <div class="content">
        Plot details are as under:
    </div>

    <div class="details">
        <div><span>a. Plot No:</span> <b><span class="ppropertyNo"></span></b></div>
